idence.episodes\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"analysis_results.json#/cases\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"All seven score-control pointwise coverage intervals contain 0.95; none of these finite-sample estimates establishes nominal coverage or a finite-sample guarantee.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"final.evidence.episodes\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"analysis_results.json#/cases\",\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/METHOD.md\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Descriptive pooled coverage is 0.9425223214285714; no iid binomial interval is attached to the condition-pooled rate.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"final.metric.coverage\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"paper_data.json#/final_evaluation/metrics/coverage\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Descriptive pooled mean_width is 0.12988779848794016; no iid binomial interval is attached to the condition-pooled rate.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"final.metric.mean_width\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"paper_data.json#/final_evaluation/metrics/mean_width\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Final evaluation status is completed and outcome is qualified, with correct=true in the qualification record. Acceptance does not establish nominal validity or implementation identity.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"final.qualification.status\",\n        \"final.qualification.outcome\",\n        \"final.qualification.correct\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"paper_data.json#/final_evaluation\"\n      ],\n      \"visible_translation\": \"Completed and qualified; internal correctness field is not surfaced in visible manuscript.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Candidate diagnostics are unverified; gate-specific failure causes and condition sampling mechanisms are not supplied. No named task transfer or executed matched affine/spline ablation is evidenced.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"final.evidence.episodes\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"paper_data.json#/final_evaluation/evaluation_evidence\",\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/METHOD.md\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"The archived target is the binary superpopulation E[Y], with unchanged labeled outcomes and labeled/unlabeled frozen scalar scores, alpha=0.05, and no truth or condition identity supplied to inference.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"result.top_program_01\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/program.py#L1-L44\"\n      ],\n      \"source_role\": \"Registry source is an archived-method path anchor only; its scalar score does not substantiate implementation details or final source identity. Inspect the readable files in evidence_refs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Archived calibration uses two complementary labeled folds and two unlabeled folds; training-only intercept, centering/scaling, ridge/GCV and quantile knots; heldout controls are clipped to [0,1].\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"result.top_program_01\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/program.py#L51-L102\",\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/program.py#L123-L171\"\n      ],\n      \"source_role\": \"Registry source is an archived-method path anchor only; its scalar score does not substantiate implementation details or final source identity. Inspect the readable files in evidence_refs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Archived hyperparameters: training sizes <4 or score range <1e-12 retain the constant; feature scale floor 1e-8; up to three quartile knots at training size >=16; up to seven quantile knots at size>=64; penalties 0.001,0.01,0.1,1,10; GCV uses trace degrees of freedom and denominator floor 1/m.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"result.top_program_01\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [\n        \"HoerlKennard1970\",\n        \"Golub1979GCV\"\n      ],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/program.py#L58-L93\"\n      ],\n      \"source_role\": \"Registry source is an archived-method path anchor only; its scalar score does not substantiate implementation details or final source identity. Inspect the readable files in evidence_refs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Archived fold estimator is residual mean plus rho times unlabeled calibrated mean with rho=N/(n+N), using fixed labeled-fold-size weights. Pooled residual/control variance and Wilson-style stabilization are approximate, not a finite-sample proof; n<16 uses labeled-only exact binomial inversion by a size-only rule.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"result.top_program_01\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/program.py#L123-L185\",\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/program.py#L246-L259\"\n      ],\n      \"source_role\": \"Registry source is an archived-method path anchor only; its scalar score does not substantiate implementation details or final source identity. Inspect the readable files in evidence_refs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"For fixed square-integrable controls under independent common-population iid samples, the stated variance decomposition, conditional-mean oracle variance, excess rho*Var(g-m)/n and unrestricted affine projection gap hold. They are not measured oracle attainment or validity of the fitted-control interval.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"result.top_program_01\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/METHOD.md\",\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/study.py#L12-L26\"\n      ],\n      \"source_role\": \"Registry source is an archived-method path anchor only; its scalar score does not substantiate implementation details or final source identity. Inspect the readable files in evidence_refs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"The separate unmeasured bounded construction uses empirical-Bernstein radii with log(4/delta), support lengths, singleton/full-range fallback, delta=alpha/(2K), and fixed nonnegative aggregation. A conditional union-bound coverage argument assumes independent iid common-population samples. These endpoints are not the primary returned track.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"result.top_program_01\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [\n        \"MaurerPontil2009\",\n        \"Hoeffding1963\"\n      ],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/program.py#L109-L185\",\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/METHOD.md\"\n      ],\n      \"source_role\": \"Registry source is an archived-method path anchor only; its scalar score does not substantiate implementation details or final source identity. Inspect the readable files in evidence_refs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"An affine-only matched function and oracle reporting helper are present but have no supplied measured results. No new experiments, bootstrap, jackknife or sensitivity sweep were run during drafting.\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"result.top_program_01\",\n        \"final.evidence.episodes\"\n      ],\n      \"citation_keys\": [],\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/program.py#L188-L192\",\n        \"source_evidence/calibration/study.py\",\n        \"scripts/build_artifacts.py\"\n      ],\n      \"source_role\": \"Registry source is an archived-method path anchor only; its scalar score does not substantiate implementation details or final source identity. Inspect the readable files in evidence_refs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"Literature context: Approximat